WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.300
Claimant: My $850 laptop was stolen from a locked library locker during a 30-minute visit and has not been recovered. I filed a police report that same afternoon; the reference number is FIC-2048.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:16.600
Adjuster: On what date was the laptop stolen?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:22.150
Claimant: I don’t know the date; I only know the theft happened before I filed the police report that afternoon.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:41.350
Adjuster: Decision: covered. The $850 laptop theft away from home is covered subject to the $100 deductible, and the police report requirement is satisfied; neither supplied clause requires the theft date. Relevant clauses: HOME-PP-1, HOME-PP-2. Confidence: 1.00.
